-- Opaque handles = S64. Entities (ECS) = U64. Status 0 = OK.
-- ALB | is STRING CONCAT (not bitwise OR).
-- Place alb_wicked.dll (+ dxcompiler.dll, shaders/, D3D12/) beside the exe.
-- =====================================================================

